() Tj T*
(The INVOICE table \(provided\):) Tj T*
(+----------+----------+-----------+------------+-----------+-----------+----------+----------+) Tj T*
(| INV_NUM  | PROD_NUM | SALE_DATE | PROD_LABEL | VEND_CODE | VEND_NAME |QUANT_SOLD|PROD_PRICE|) Tj T*
(+----------+----------+-----------+------------+-----------+-----------+----------+----------+) Tj T*
(| 211347   |AA-E3522QW|15-Jan-2018| Rot. sander|    211    |NeverFail  |     1    |  $34.46  |) Tj T*
(| 211347   |QD-300932X|15-Jan-2018| Drill bit  |    211    |NeverFail  |     8    |   $2.73  |) Tj T*
(| 211347   |RU-995748G|15-Jan-2018| Band saw   |    309    |BeGood     |     1    |  $31.59  |) Tj T*
(| 211348   |AA-E3522QW|15-Jan-2018| Rot. sander|    211    |NeverFail  |     2    |  $34.46  |) Tj T*
(| 211349   |GH-778345P|16-Jan-2018| Power drill|    157    |ToughGo    |     1    |  $69.32  |) Tj T*
(+----------+----------+-----------+------------+-----------+-----------+----------+----------+) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Composite Primary Key: INV_NUM + PROD_NUM) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
(5. Dependency Diagram and All Dependencies \(1NF Analysis\)) Tj T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The table has no repeating groups and already contains single values per cell,) Tj T*
(so it is already in 1NF. The composite primary key is INV_NUM + PROD_NUM.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Identified Dependencies:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  FULL dependency \(on the full composite key\):) Tj T*
(    INV_NUM, PROD_NUM -> QUANT_SOLD) Tj T*
(    \(You need BOTH the invoice number AND product number to know the) Tj T*
(     quantity sold on that specific invoice line.\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  PARTIAL dependencies \(on only part of the composite key\):) Tj T*
(    INV_NUM -> SALE_DATE) Tj T*
(    \(The sale date belongs to the invoice, not the product.\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    PROD_NUM -> PROD_LABEL) Tj T*
(    \(The product label describes the product, not the invoice.\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    PROD_NUM -> VEND_CODE) Tj T*
(    \(The vendor code is a property of the product.\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(    PROD_NUM -> PROD_PRICE) Tj T*
(    \(The product price belongs to the product, not the invoice.\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  TRANSITIVE dependency \(non-key attribute depends on another non-key attribute\):) Tj T*
(    VEND_CODE -> VEND_NAME) Tj T*
(    \(The vendor name is determined by the vendor code, not directly) Tj T*
(     by the primary key -- this is a transitive dependency.\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  Full dependency path \(through partial\):) Tj T*
(    PROD_NUM -> VEND_CODE -> VEND_NAME) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(See file: Q5_dependency_diagram.drawio for the visual dependency diagram.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
