() Tj T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
(6. Remove Partial Dependencies -- Conversion to 2NF) Tj T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(To convert to 2NF, we remove all partial dependencies by splitting the table.) Tj T*
(Each part of the composite primary key becomes the primary key of a new table,) Tj T*
(and attributes that depend only on that part move into that table. Attributes) Tj T*
(that depend on the full composite key stay in a linking table.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Resulting 2NF tables:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  INVOICE \(INV_NUM [PK], SALE_DATE\)) Tj T*
(    -- INV_NUM determines SALE_DATE \(partial dep resolved\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  PRODUCT \(PROD_NUM [PK], PROD_LABEL, VEND_CODE, VEND_NAME, PROD_PRICE\)) Tj T*
(    -- PROD_NUM determines all these attributes \(partial deps resolved\)) Tj T*
(    -- Note: VEND_CODE -> VEND_NAME transitive dependency still exists here) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  INVOICE_PRODUCT \(INV_NUM [PK/FK], PROD_NUM [PK/FK], QUANT_SOLD\)) Tj T*
(    -- Full composite key determines QUANT_SOLD) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Relational schemas:) Tj T*
(  INVOICE \(INV_NUM, SALE_DATE\)) Tj T*
(  PRODUCT \(PROD_NUM, PROD_LABEL, VEND_CODE, VEND_NAME, PROD_PRICE\)) Tj T*
(  INVOICE_PRODUCT \(INV_NUM, PROD_NUM, QUANT_SOLD\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(See file: Q6_2NF_diagrams.drawio for the visual dependency diagrams.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
(7. Remove Transitive Dependencies -- Conversion to 3NF) Tj T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The PRODUCT table from 2NF still has a transitive dependency:) Tj T*
(  PROD_NUM -> VEND_CODE -> VEND_NAME) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(To convert to 3NF, we remove the transitive dependency by extracting VEND_CODE) Tj T*
(and VEND_NAME into their own table. VEND_CODE stays in PRODUCT as a foreign key) Tj T*
(to link to the new VENDOR table.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Resulting 3NF tables:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  INVOICE \(INV_NUM [PK], SALE_DATE\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  PRODUCT \(PROD_NUM [PK], PROD_LABEL, VEND_CODE [FK], PROD_PRICE\)) Tj T*
(    -- CHG_HOUR removed; VEND_CODE stays as foreign key to VENDOR) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  VENDOR \(VEND_CODE [PK], VEND_NAME\)) Tj T*
(    -- New table created from transitive dependency) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  INVOICE_PRODUCT \(INV_NUM [PK/FK], PROD_NUM [PK/FK], QUANT_SOLD\)) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj

