(Final relational schemas \(3NF\):) Tj T*
(  INVOICE \(INV_NUM, SALE_DATE\)) Tj T*
(  PRODUCT \(PROD_NUM, PROD_LABEL, VEND_CODE, PROD_PRICE\)) Tj T*
(  VENDOR \(VEND_CODE, VEND_NAME\)) Tj T*
(  INVOICE_PRODUCT \(INV_NUM, PROD_NUM, QUANT_SOLD\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The database is now in 3NF: no partial dependencies, no transitive dependencies,) Tj T*
(and each table represents a single subject.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(See file: Q7_3NF_diagrams.drawio for the visual dependency diagrams.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
